    "sub_name": "公司治理",
    "sub_ename": "CORPORATE GOVERNANCE",
    "describe_ch": "協助學生經由公司治理理論、相關法規規範、學術研究成果與實例了解現代公司治理之治理\n目的、治理方法及治理過程，並思考如何發展及建構公司治理機制各不同類型及規模之企\n業。",
    "describe_eh": "The course help students realize the purpose, the approach, and the process of modern corporate governance through review of theories, laws and regulations, academic research results, and real practices. The course also explores how to develop and construct corporate governance mechanisms for different kind of industries.",
